Package: empleR
Title: Tools for Analyzing Peru's National Employment Surveys (EPEN/EPE)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Valentina", "Linares Herrera", , "durgavalentinalinaresherrera@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = ""))
Description: Provides tools to download, read, and analyze microdata from Peru's
    national employment surveys: the Encuesta Permanente de Empleo Nacional
    (EPEN, 2022-present) and its predecessor the Encuesta Permanente de Empleo
    (EPE, until 2021). Key features include automatic harmonization of occupational
    classifiers (CNO 2015 and CO-95), calculation of labor market indicators
    using complex survey design, regional visualization via interactive maps,
    and integration with an AI occupational exposure index.
